  <item>
    <title>总裁20年职场复盘：人生的旷野中，普通人如何做选择</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e397513a5ff0a0ca16ff55</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e397513a5ff0a0ca16ff55</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 13 Sep 2024 01:37:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：白玉兰奖获得者罗兰</span></p><span></span><p><span>加入听友群继续讨论：加微信bossltea</span></p><span></span><p><span>shownotes:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="77">01:17</a> 毕业后第一份工作，以及美国职场环境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="139">02:19</a> think out of the box</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="208">03:28</a> 校招面试初体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="273">04:33</a> 没有那么热爱的时候，只能做到及格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="415">06:55</a> 接到猎头电话，开启第二份工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="501">08:21</a> 总裁在职场初期，也会面对很多拒绝和不认可</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="627">10:27</a> 职场中做过很多错事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 给年轻人的建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="854">14:14</a> 去大企业还是小公司？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1266">21:06</a> 读MBA是职业发展的捷径嘛？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1401">23:21</a> 放弃14万美金和各种package：钱可以去挣的，但机会并不是什么时候都有</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1521">25:21</a> &nbsp;在咨询公司的经历和成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1733">28:53</a> 面对咨询公司的巨大压力，你做好吃苦准备了嘛？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2046">34:06</a> 咨询加EMBA的魔鬼训练</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2292">38:12</a> 职场又一次转折：从咨询到战略</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2356">39:16</a> 遇到人生最大低谷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2477">41:17</a> 如何成为基金合伙人？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2642">44:02</a> 说说人脉和贵人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2797">46:37</a> 女性在职场中需要克服的问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2914">48:34</a> 对创业者的建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3458">57:38</a> 职场中男女是否平等？</span></p>]]></description>
