  <item>
    <title>偶像来了！留学到底有什么用？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d088bad06ec988f2c721f8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d088bad06ec988f2c721f8</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 29 Aug 2024 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾罗兰是我的偶像，她是云砺科技的创始人，也是上海市白玉兰奖的获得者。我个人受她的影响很深。她的人生故事太精彩，我们就先从留学开始聊起吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【加听友群】</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果对本期嘉宾、内容感兴趣，想和我们继续聊聊，欢迎加入听友群，加小助理微信：bossltea</span></p><span></span><p><span>【show notes】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="178">02:58</a> 获得白玉兰奖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="276">04:36</a> 成长经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="547">09:07</a> 在初中、高中还是大学出国比较好？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="603">10:03</a> 国外上大学很难融入当地社会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="656">10:56</a> 日本的教育是怎么样的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="776">12:56</a> 日本的武士道精神和讲规矩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="983">16:23</a> 从0开始学日语</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="952">15:52</a> 要不要把小孩送到日本读书？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1182">19:42</a> 日本学校有霸凌吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1202">20:02</a> 日本的教育和美国的教育，哪个更好？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1517">25:17</a> 打工是留学不可缺少的部分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1788">29:48</a> 甜甜的校园爱情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1923">32:03</a> 美国男友教会我的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2204">36:44</a> 原生家庭对人的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2299">38:19</a> 留学会不会导致爱的缺失？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpcQNakhbalXqkAgGFS45qmtj28F.m4a" length="22654638" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:42:24</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv1nz_2c2RVbwxbSnDQYXrxpNHp-.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>人际交往终极解决方案：做人要简单，做事要周全。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66b0b75533ddcbb53c72bd6d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66b0b75533ddcbb53c72bd6d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 05 Aug 2024 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期内容】本期是和Cynthia录制的下篇。Cynthia是公司总裁，也是一位超级大销售。她有一句名言：别人签不了的单，我能签，我签不了的单，别人也一定签不了。上期她给我们传授了很多不为人知的沟通技巧，这期她继续和我们聊聊社交，以及销售技巧如何助力职业发展。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【加听友群】</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果对本期嘉宾、内容感兴趣，想和我们继续聊聊，欢迎加入听友群，加小助理微信：bossltea</span></p><span></span><p><span>【show notes】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="84">01:24</a> 关于销售的错误认知</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="161">02:41</a> 心理投射</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="218">03:38</a> 吸引力法则</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="238">03:58</a> 唤起别人的善意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="350">05:50</a> 销售需要口才很好吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="536">08:56</a> 好人能不能做销售？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="708">11:48</a> i人能不能做销售？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="800">13:20</a> 友谊和利益只能二选一？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="952">15:52</a> 对人性的洞察</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1048">17:28</a> 如何识人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1202">20:02</a> 做人要简单，做事要周全</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1302">21:42</a> 成单是不是玄学？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1491">24:51</a> 努力到天花板，只能占50%</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1558">25:58</a> 销售技巧如何助力职业发展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1628">27:08</a> 从半年不开单，到成为销冠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1711">28:31</a> 30岁前要做到管理层</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1948">32:28</a> 怎么让老板知道你？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2041">34:01</a> 怎么看待和老板的信任？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2140">35:40</a> 怎么克服业绩焦虑？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2633">43:53</a> 销售是创造需求还是满足需求</span></p><span></span><p><span>【配乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头歌曲：Into The Wind</span></p><span></span><p><span>作者：Blue Wednesday/Magnus Klausen</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾歌曲：Moon</span></p><span></span><p><span>作者：Misha/Monma/cocabona</span></p>]]></description>
