    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv1nz_2c2RVbwxbSnDQYXrxpNHp-.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>人生处处皆销售：三个沟通技巧拯救嘴笨的人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a9f3fb7349f7a557cdba9b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a9f3fb7349f7a557cdba9b</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 31 Jul 2024 08:21:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Cynthia，传媒公司总裁，大客户签单之王</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期内容】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Cynthia是一位超级大销售。她有一句名言：别人签不了的单，我能签，我签不了的单，别人也一定签不了。今天她将和我们聊聊，一个好销售的底层构建，以及大家日常关心的问题：比如，怎么约人吃饭，被拒绝的时候怎么调整心态，如何交朋友，如何获得别人的信任，被当众刁难怎么办等等。对销售感兴趣的朋友可以听一听，然后再决定是不是要从事销售这份职业。而我意外地发现对接客户就和谈恋爱一样，学会了谈客户，就学会了谈对象。希望今天这期节目可以给大家带来愉悦的体验和小小的技能提升。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【听友群】</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果对本期内容感兴趣，想要继续和我们讨论，欢迎加入听友群，加小助理微信：bossltea</span></p><span></span><p><span>【show notes】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="108">01:48</a> 销售也是普通人，毕业如何找工作、租房子砍价</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a> 克服被围观的羞耻感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="457">07:37</a> 销售避免太敏感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="529">08:49</a> business isbusiness</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="582">09:42</a> 销售是因缘果的实战阵地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">11:40</a> 怎么和三教九流的人沟通</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="761">12:41</a> 沟通首先要定基调</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1004">16:44</a> 在合适的场合、合适的时机，对合适的人，讲合适的话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1068">17:48</a> 冯唐是怎么汇报工作的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1194">19:54</a> 如何准确完整表达</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1294">21:34</a> 准备30秒电梯演讲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1456">24:16</a> 沟通要及时，少说多问</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1552">25:52</a> 沟通的反驳区</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1606">26:46</a> 见人说人话，见鬼说鬼话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1782">29:42</a> 怎么约人吃饭，以及话术</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2212">36:52</a> 销售怎么交朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2257">37:37</a> 不追求别人的信任</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2399">39:59</a> 放弃一些精神洁癖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2469">41:09</a> 怎么维护人际关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2633">43:53</a> 如何向上社交</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2808">46:48</a> 总结</span></p><span></span><p><span>【配乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头歌曲：Wild Orchid</span></p><span></span><p><span>作者：devon rea/Etymology Records</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾歌曲：palms</span></p><span></span><p><span>作者：olli</span></p>]]></description>
